## Modifications

The models in this repository have been modified from the original BodyParts3D data:
1. **Cropping**: Extracted right foot structures from whole-body mesh data
2. **Format Conversion**: Converted from OBJ to GLB for web optimization
3. **Naming**: Mapped FMA IDs to English/Chinese anatomical names per TA2 standards
4. **Integration**: Packaged into interactive React Three Fiber application

## Original Data Characteristics

- **Method**: Polygonal mesh data from whole-body MRI scans
- **Simplification**: 99% polygon reduction applied
- **Nomenclature**: Based on Foundational Model of Anatomy (FMA)
- **Laterality**: Original data labeled as dexter (right) / sinister (left)
- **Quality**: Medical education grade, suitable for teaching and research

